<%# What a person can do about one competition, wherever it is shown — the
    public page, the in-app list and the home card.

    A student says „ще участвам" (and can take it back) and can build a
    session for it, entered or not — where the bank holds enough of its
    problems near them (CompetitionPractice.ready?). Where it does not, the
    button is ordinary practice and says why, rather than promising a
    preparation session it would fill with three problems. A visitor is sent to make an account, with
    the competition riding along so the account is entered in it. Anybody
    else — a parent, an admin — gets nothing to press: an entry is a child's,
    and a parent makes it from inside the child's profile.

    locals: event, entry (the student's, or nil), hero (bigger buttons) %>
<% hero = local_assigns[:hero] %>
<% size = hero ? "button-hero" : "" %>

<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:items-stretch">
  <% if current_user&.student? %>
    <% if competition_ready?(event) %>
      <%= button_to competition_practice_path(event.slug), class: "button button-primary #{size} w-full", form_class: "max-sm:w-full" do %>
        <%= t("competitions.practice", name: event.short.presence || event.name.to_s) %> →
      <% end %>
    <% else %>
      <p class="w-full text-sm font-bold text-ink-600"><%= t("competitions.not_ready", name: event.short.presence || event.name.to_s) %></p>
      <%= button_to daily_assignment_path, class: "button button-primary #{size} w-full", form_class: "max-sm:w-full" do %>
        <%= t("competitions.practise_as_usual") %> →
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
    <%# An exam has a mock paper too (MockExam): timed, no help, scored at the end. %>
    <% if event.exam? %>
      <%= link_to t("mock_exam.start"), new_competition_mock_path(event.slug), class: "button button-secondary #{size} max-sm:w-full" %>
    <% end %>
    <%# Its real past papers, where the bank has them (PastPapers). %>
    <% if PastPapers.grades(event.slug).any? %>
      <%= link_to t("past_papers.title"), competition_papers_path(event.slug), class: "button button-secondary #{size} max-sm:w-full" %>
    <% end %>

    <% if entry %>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1 text-sm font-extrabold text-green-700">✓ <%= t("competitions.entered") %></span>
      <%= button_to t("competitions.leave"), competition_entry_path(event.slug), method: :delete,
                    class: "px-1 text-meta font-bold text-ink-500 hover:text-ink-800 hover:underline",
                    form_class: "inline" %>
    <% elsif event.upcoming? %>
      <%= button_to t("competitions.join"), competition_entry_path(event.slug),
                    class: "button button-secondary #{size} w-full", form_class: "max-sm:w-full" %>
    <% end %>
  <% elsif current_user.nil? %>
    <%= link_to sign_up_path(competition: event.slug), class: "button button-primary #{size}" do %>
      <%= t(event.upcoming? ? "competitions.join_sign_up" : "competitions.practice_sign_up") %> →
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
</div>
